Package: whodigitalhealthmonitor
Title: Global Digital Health Index and Monitor Maturity Scoring
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Utkarsha", "Tiwari", email = "drutkarsha.tiwari.official@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for structuring, validating, and scoring digital health
    ecosystem maturity across the seven WHO/ITU eHealth Strategy Framework
    components and core indicators defined in the Global Digital Health Index
    (GDHI) Indicator Guide (evolved into the Global Digital Health Monitor).
